# Particle Snake

Route `/particle-snake`. Logic stays in `components/snake/`. Read Project 03 in @cyber_playground_roadmap.md.

- Neon arcade shell. The high score is stored in localStorage.
- The body leaves a trail and deforms slightly on a sharp turn.
- Eating food bursts dozens of particles that respect gravity and friction.
- A milestone or game over shakes the viewport.
- Motion work reads `.agents/skills/emil-design-eng/SKILL.md`.
